---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Timeline of one write under synchronous, semi-synchronous and asynchronous replication. Positions are illustrative, not measured.
---
<figure class="rf">
  <div class="rf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 372" role="img" aria-label="Three timelines for one write. Synchronous: the leader waits for all followers before the client hears OK. Semi-synchronous: it waits for one. Asynchronous: the client hears OK at once and the copies arrive later. If the leader dies right after OK, only the asynchronous setup can lose the write.">
    <text x="240" y="22" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>time →</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thời gian →</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={40} y={100} size={30} />
    <text x="70" y="105" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>Synchronous</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đồng bộ</tspan></text>
    <line x1="250" y1="100" x2="700" y2="100" class="edge " />
    <circle cx="250" cy="100" r="6" class="box strong" />
    <text x="250" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>write</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ghi</tspan></text>
    <circle cx="400" cy="100" r="7" class="box strong" />
    <text x="400" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>F1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>F1</tspan></text>
    <circle cx="510" cy="100" r="7" class="box strong" />
    <text x="510" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>F2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>F2</tspan></text>
    <circle cx="620" cy="100" r="7" class="box strong" />
    <text x="620" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>F3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>F3</tspan></text>
    <circle cx="660" cy="100" r="8" class="box ok" />
    <text x="660" y="130" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>client hears "OK"</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>client nghe "OK"</tspan></text>
    <text x="716" y="96" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Nothing lost</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không mất gì</tspan></text>
    <text x="716" y="114" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>every follower has it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mọi follower đã có</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={40} y={204} size={30} />
    <text x="70" y="209" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>Semi-synchronous</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bán đồng bộ</tspan></text>
    <line x1="250" y1="204" x2="700" y2="204" class="edge " />
    <circle cx="250" cy="204" r="6" class="box strong" />
    <text x="250" y="190" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>write</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ghi</tspan></text>
    <circle cx="400" cy="204" r="7" class="box strong" />
    <text x="400" y="190" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>F1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>F1</tspan></text>
    <circle cx="540" cy="204" r="7" class="box empty" />
    <text x="540" y="190" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>F2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>F2</tspan></text>
    <circle cx="640" cy="204" r="7" class="box empty" />
    <text x="640" y="190" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>F3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>F3</tspan></text>
    <circle cx="450" cy="204" r="8" class="box ok" />
    <text x="450" y="234" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>client hears "OK"</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>client nghe "OK"</tspan></text>
    <text x="716" y="200" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Nothing lost</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không mất gì</tspan></text>
    <text x="716" y="218" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>one follower has it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một follower đã có</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={40} y={308} size={30} />
    <text x="70" y="313" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>Asynchronous</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất đồng bộ</tspan></text>
    <line x1="250" y1="308" x2="700" y2="308" class="edge " />
    <circle cx="250" cy="308" r="6" class="box strong" />
    <text x="250" y="294" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>write</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ghi</tspan></text>
    <circle cx="450" cy="308" r="7" class="box empty" />
    <text x="450" y="294" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>F1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>F1</tspan></text>
    <circle cx="550" cy="308" r="7" class="box empty" />
    <text x="550" y="294" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>F2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>F2</tspan></text>
    <circle cx="650" cy="308" r="7" class="box empty" />
    <text x="650" y="294" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>F3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>F3</tspan></text>
    <circle cx="290" cy="308" r="8" class="box ok" />
    <text x="290" y="338" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>client hears "OK"</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>client nghe "OK"</tspan></text>
    <text x="716" y="304" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>May lose recent writes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Có thể mất lần ghi mới</tspan></text>
    <text x="716" y="322" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>copies still on the way</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bản sao còn đang tới</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Same write, three setups. The client hears "OK" at the gold dot. Hollow dots are copies that arrive after it; if the leader dies first, those copies never exist.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cùng một lần ghi, ba cấu hình. Client nghe "OK" ở chấm vàng. Chấm rỗng là các bản sao tới sau đó; nếu leader chết trước thì các bản sao ấy không bao giờ có.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .rf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .rf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .rf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rf .t-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-hs { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .t-mono { font-size: 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .t-ok { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .rf .box.strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.empty { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .rf .box.bad.empty { fill: none; }
  .rf .edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .rf .edge.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.ok { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .head.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .rf .head.ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .rf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
